        return (
            ScheduledJob(
                "purge-old-messages",
                parse_cron("0 0 * * *"),
                PurgeOldMessages(PurgeRepository(wiring.session_factory)),
            ),
        )

    The name is the key of the job's row in `job_runs`; renaming it starts a new history. A
    repository that a request and a job both use belongs on `Wiring`.
